    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 2 Orlagh Lawn is a substantial five-bedroom detached family residence enjoying a prime position overlooking a large communal green within this mature and highly sought-after development in the heart of Knocklyon. Extending to approximately 157 square metres, this well-maintained home offers bright, generously proportioned accommodation ideally suited to modern family living.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, guest wc, elegant sitting room with feature dual fuel stove and bespoke display cabinetry, utility room and an impressive open-plan kitchen/family room. The kitchen is fitted with an extensive range of floor and eye-level units, wooden worktops, a central freestanding island and a second dual fuel stove, while an abundance of windows and multiple access points create a bright and highly functional family space with excellent connection to the rear garden.\n\nUpstairs, there are five bedrooms, including a generous principal bedroom with ensuite shower room and built-in wardrobes. The remaining bedrooms are well proportioned and offer flexibility for growing families, guest accommodation or home office use. A fully tiled family bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nThe property also features a floored attic, suitable for storage, and is accessed by a 'Staighre' folding staircase for added convenience. Offering an abundance of additional storage space, the attic is a practical and valuable feature of the home. \n\nOutside, the property benefits from off-street parking to the front and a private rear garden which can be accessed from the kitchen/family room and utility room. The rear garden features two patio areas, outdoor lighting and a covered side passage which provides excellent shed/storage space. Occupying a quiet end-of-cul-de-sac position and overlooking the communal green, the property enjoys a wonderful sense of space and a safe environment for family living.\n\nOrlagh Lawn is ideally located within easy reach of a host of local amenities including excellent primary and secondary schools, shopping facilities, parks and sporting clubs. The area is well served by public transport links and offers convenient access to the M50, making it an ideal location for families and commuters alike.\n\nGARDEN\nTo the front, the property benefits from off-street parking on a private driveway. The sunny south-facing rear garden enjoys all-day sunshine, which also streams into the impressive family room and kitchen. A generous patio area provides the perfect setting for al fresco dining and outdoor entertaining."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 7.09m x 7.24m\nTiled flooring, box bay window overlooking front, carpeted stairs, under-stairs storage.\n\nGuest WC - 1.47m x 1.26m\nFully tiled with wash hand basin and w.c.\n\nLiving Room - \nAccessed through double doors with carpet flooring, two windows overlooking front, integrated display cabinets and dual fuel stove.\n\nUtility Room - 2.62m x 1.65m\nWith tiled flooring, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, along with a sink. Door leading to side entrance, shelving and additional storage cupboards.\n\nKitchen/Family Room - 7.09m x 6.29m\nFitted kitchen with a range of floor and eye-level units, wooden worktops, integrated Neff oven and grill, and integrated fridge. Central free-standing island with wooden countertop. Bay windows overlook the rear garden, with an additional window to the side providing excellent natural light. Dual fuel stove. Double doors and additional door providing access to the rear garden.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.26m x 4.04m\nGenerous double bedroom with carpet flooring, fitted wardrobes and bay window to rear.\n\nEnsuite - 1.00m x 2.35m\nFully tiled en-suite with window to side. Wash hand basin. w.c. and fully tiled shower cubicle.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.63m x 4.17m\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring, fitted wardrobes and window to rear.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.03m x 3.39m\nSingle bedroom with carpet flooring, window overlooking front.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.00m x 4.23m\nSingle bedroom with carpet flooring, window overlooking front and built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 5 / Home Office - 2.35m x 3.15m\nSingle bedroom with carpet flooring, currently in use as a home office.\n\nBathroom - 2.00m x 3.00m\nFully tiled bathroom with window to side. bath, wash hand basin, separate shower cubicle with glass surround illuminated wall mounted mirror and heated towel rail.\n\n"
      },
